{"id":"mai_s","lemma":"maïs","pos":"noun","rank":3241,"glosses":["corn, maize"],"ipa":"/ma.is/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ed/Fr-ma%C3%AFs.ogg/Fr-ma%C3%AFs.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","examples":[{"text":"Je suis allergique au maïs.","en":"I'm allergic to corn.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/251552","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"allergic"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Qui veut du maïs soufflé?","en":"Who wants popcorn?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"of the / some"},null,{"g":"to blow","l":"souffler"}]},{"text":"Le bourbon est fait à partir de maïs.","en":"Bourbon is made from corn.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"bourbon"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,7,"from […] onward"]]},{"text":"La famille entière était dehors à récolter le maïs.","en":"The whole family was out harvesting the corn.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"family"},{"g":"whole","l":"entier"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"outside"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to harvest"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Combien d'épis de maïs as-tu achetés ?","en":"How many ears of corn did you buy?","words":[{"g":"how much"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"ear, spike","l":"épi"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},null]}]}